<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Potential</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">sombr</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Potential</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4cpHvqL4dvporE8JlQwkec</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.872" end="00:25.440">Everytime we'd wake up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.440" end="00:29.808">I got to see you with no make up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.808" end="00:34.093">Yeah, you hated how it looked off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.093" end="00:37.684">But, baby, that's just how you grew up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.684" end="00:39.807" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.807" end="00:44.267">There'll be someone new for you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.267" end="00:48.819">I'm not worried 'bout you (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.819" end="00:53.094">I'll be somewhere going crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.094" end="00:56.278">I'll be stuck on you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.278" end="00:57.778" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.702" end="00:58.963">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.963" end="01:00.803">Makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.803" end="01:05.550">Not having you (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.550" end="01:07.970">And it drives me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.970" end="01:12.001">That my baby thinks were through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.001" end="01:15.079">So soon (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.079" end="01:16.579" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.319" end="01:17.107">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.107" end="01:19.300">It makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.300" end="01:21.469">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.469" end="01:23.742">It makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.742" end="01:25.956">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.956" end="01:28.159">It makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.159" end="01:30.409">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.409" end="01:32.348">And now I'm mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.348" end="01:33.848" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.398" end="01:36.307">It was a difficult break up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.307" end="01:40.868">But I wrote some songs that got me famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.868" end="01:45.214">Sometimes I think about what it costs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.214" end="01:49.023">You were the last one that I could trust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.023" end="01:50.858" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.858" end="01:55.310">There'll be someone new for you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.310" end="01:59.827">I'm not worried 'bout you (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.827" end="02:04.205">I'll be somewhere going crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.205" end="02:07.526">I'll be stuck on you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.526" end="02:09.026" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.905" end="02:10.097">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.097" end="02:11.852">Makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.852" end="02:16.617">Not having you (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.617" end="02:19.057">And it drives me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.057" end="02:22.988">That my baby thinks were through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.988" end="02:26.026">So soon (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.026" end="02:27.526" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.501" end="02:31.968">And when I fall I'm blaming you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.968" end="02:36.009">That doesn't make it your fault</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.009" end="02:41.123">But it still makes it true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.123" end="02:45.504">I play alone in this game for two</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.504" end="02:49.404">You aren't the final boss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.404" end="02:55.464">But you still make me lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.464" end="02:56.964" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.759" end="02:59.059">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.059" end="03:00.802">Makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.802" end="03:05.550">Not having you (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.550" end="03:07.953">And it drives me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.953" end="03:12.025">That my baby thinks were through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.025" end="03:14.507">So soon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.507" end="03:16.802">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.802" end="03:18.487">Makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.487" end="03:23.107">Not having you (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.107" end="03:25.654">And it drives me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.654" end="03:29.958">That my baby thinks were through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.958" end="03:32.213">So soon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.213" end="03:33.713" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.284" end="03:37.913">Drives me crazy that my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.913" end="03:41.561">Drives me crazy, that, that babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.561" end="03:43.732">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:43.732" end="03:45.932">It makes me mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.932" end="03:48.207">We had potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:48.207" end="03:52.207">And now I'm mental</p></div></body></tt>